Description: Ultra-optimized C++26 Vietnamese IME for Fcitx5 — Telex/Raw, Wayland/XWayland/Electron/Wine
 An ultra-optimized, allocation-minimized C++26 Vietnamese Input Method
 Engine (IME) addon for the Fcitx5 framework on Linux. Designed for users
 who demand low input latency and stable floating-panel composition.
